  "affected_inside_the_published_51_game_window": 0,
  "materiality": "None of the affected slots falls in the 2026-11-06..11-12 window that the site's leaderboard was graded on, so no published pick changes today. The effect is on the October half of the season, which is where any future full-season backtest would live, and on the rest column shown for 2026-10-25 .. 2026-11-05.",
  "cause": "engine_v2/context.py builds its team history from gamelog['games'] and scripts/originate_horizon.py from games that carry a score, so the 23 fixtures listed in the same file are never in either history, even though the file's note says they keep the rest layer complete."
 },
